{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-17","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：平面与平行线与比例","englishTitle":"If two straight lines be cut by parallel planes, they will be cut in the same ratios.","book":11,"number":17,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":17,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","contentId":"euclid-11-17","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc23a52ec8d46ba17d7da0cbe4a18b4293efe124c2a028cc96dde81b8d8f47c4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-17.statement","euclid-11-17.construction.1","euclid-11-17.construction.2","euclid-11-17.proof.1","euclid-11-17.proof.2","euclid-11-17.proof.3","euclid-11-17.proof.4","euclid-11-17.proof.5","euclid-11-17.conclusion","euclid-11-17.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-17.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0acc3e1581eab59318a70737f96cb5db14133733f50472e0efb086cdc6ed829b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two straight lines be cut by parallel planes, they will be cut in the same ratios."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条直线被平行的平面线截断,它们将以同样的比例被削减。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-17.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"837447305a6b507f515f0babd2d45529b5fbf2b1d94a14244f5ab2d20b5c379e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two straight lines AB, CD be cut by the parallel planes GH, KL, MN at the points A, E, B and C, F, D; I say that, as the straight line AE is to EB, so is CF to FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AB、CD两条直线分别从A、E、B和C点的平面、GH、MN线上划出;我说,直线AE至EB的比例等于CF至FD。（相关点与线段：KL）"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-17.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"da5b97727fb0bfd24b969a02c8527616ddaceaec938b7b5c393b4738d6ad4378","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AC, BD, AD be joined, let AD meet the plane KL at the point O, and let EO, OF be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC,BD,AD连接,AD连接平面,O点的平面,KL,EO,OF连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-17.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"abeb0be1e7a4886a9556f0b99f415159a895ebbcded3b7bdaec8269ead319427","citations":["euclid-11-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the two parallel planes KL, MN are cut by the plane EBDO, their common sections EO, BD are parallel. [[XI. 16](/principles/euclid-11-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于两个平行的平面 KL,MN 被平面 EBDO, 它们的共同部分EO,BD是平行的。 [[XI. 16](/principles/euclid-11-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-17.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f90a8345e83eded1eff06ad95fe4f9f60853f7d0c3e59defaf29fab321ddced","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, since the two parallel planes GH, KL are cut by the plane AOFC, their common sections AC, OF are parallel. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,由于两个平行的平面 GH,KL被平面 AOFC所截断,其共同的第AC,OF节是平行的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-17.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a2be075dfe614778241281c007ad41283699dceccdd858321967385505c68e4","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the straight line EO has been drawn parallel to BD, one of the sides of the triangle ABD, therefore, proportionally, as AE is to EB, so is AO to OD. [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于直线EO线与三角形ABD的侧边之一平行,因此,AE对EB的比例等于AO对OD的比例；AE 与 EB 之比等于 AO 与 OD 之比。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-17.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27709801780a43dfdd8cbe047934c3e8cbb89656d357342f5a27fa5750c6a950","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the straight line OF has been drawn parallel to AC, one of the sides of the triangle ADC, proportionally, as AO is to OD, so is CF to FD. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于直线OF线与三角形ADC侧的AC线平行,AO对OD的比例等于CF对FD的比。 [同上。 ]；AO 与 OD 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-17.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"227a759163c7fff364de48453b2d202960de909f0366065d923dcc8461d7e57d","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved that, as AO is to OD, so is AE to EB; therefore also, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有证据表明,AO对OD的比等于AE对EB的比;因此,AE对EB的比等于CF对FD的比；AO 与 OD 之比等于 AE 与 EB 之比；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-17.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-17.source","contentId":"euclid-11-17","revisionId":"euclid-11-17@raw-bc23a52ec8d46ba1","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f9321f7accfc8f272527a358f1299713289707f7e1d0f2a7698a5e7965f832a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-17:euclid-11-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-17.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"XI. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-17:euclid-6-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-17.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"VI. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-17:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-17.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"V. 11"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-4:euclid-11-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-4.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"XI. 17"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-17:euclid-11-16:explic